---
import ScvriaLayout from "../layouts/ScvriaLayout.astro";
---

<ScvriaLayout
  title="Community — SCVRIA Sofware"
  description="How to participate in SCVRIA Sofware through its public source repositories."
>
  <section class="scvria-page scvria-prose-page">
    <header class="scvria-page-header">
      <p class="scvria-eyebrow">Participation</p>
      <h1>Community</h1>
      <p class="scvria-lead">
        SCVRIA Sofware develops in public where its source repositories are available.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="scvria-prose">
      <p>
        The public home for SCVRIA source is the <a href="https://github.com/scvriasofware">SCVRIA Sofware GitHub organization</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        Participation can happen through repository source, issues, and pull requests: report a problem, propose a change, inspect how something works, or contribute code where a repository accepts contributions.
      </p>
      <p>
        No separate forum, chat server, mailing list, or other community channel is claimed here. Use the public repository surfaces that actually exist.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</ScvriaLayout>
